## Verification Plan

### Manual
1. Run `npm start` in `FocusBookV8/` — both main window and overlay widget appear.
2. Sign in, add tasks — overlay shows today's tasks after 2 seconds of hover.
3. Check tasks from the overlay — main window updates in sync.
4. Minimize main window — overlay stays visible and on top.
5. Open a full-screen app — overlay stays on top (`screen-saver` level).
6. Click "Open FocusBook" in widget — main window comes to front.

### Build
- Run `npm run dist` to generate a Windows installer `.exe` — test the packaged app end-to-end.

